id = &"crane_fish_again"
title = "Back to the Claw"
giver = "Grandpa"
description = "Grandpa saw the cash and the scrap and liked it. Now he wants you to spend some of it at the crane: $100 a go, fish yourself some real parts.

After that, he says, go check out the downhill billie ramp."
